Dear Mr. Hamilton,

Following up on our call, I attach a draft Answer in the action brought by Ja=
mie Hamilton against Louis Pierce, Case No. 21SMCV73930.

I can confirm that the court (Superior Court of the State of Maine) has liste=
d the hearing for 08/01/2022. Please confirm that you are able to attend.

Thank you for sending the documents. On a first review the case is well docum=
ented, although a few exhibits are still missing.

The draft is attached in Word format with tracked changes. Please send me you=
r comments by 10/07/2021, as the deadline for filing the response is fixed by=
 the court rules and cannot be extended without an application.

What we still need from you: confirmation of Jamie Hamilton's address (9807 N=
ottingham Way, Portland, ME 04174), a copy of the payment slip for the deposi=
t to our client account, and scans of your correspondence for the last two ye=
ars.

Our witness, Jonathan Martin, has been told that the court may require attend=
ance; if his contact details (tel. +1 207-555-0166) change, please let us kno=
w.

